  "extract": "Eric Ries is an American entrepreneur, blogger, and author of The Lean Startup, a book on the lean startup movement. He is also the author of The Startup Way, a book on modern entrepreneurial management.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Eric Ries</b> is an American entrepreneur, blogger, and author of <i>The Lean Startup</i>, a book on the lean startup movement. He is also the author of <i>The Startup Way</i>, a book on modern entrepreneurial management.</p>"
